 "remarks": "18 Chatham Drive welcomes you home! Nestled in a sought-after Norwalk location and surrounded by larger homes, this property sits on a beautiful lot with plenty of space for gardening. Ready for your personal touch and new memories, the home features an attached garage, hardwood floors, a cozy fireplace, and an expansive lower level-a wonderful foundation for your vision. Enjoy the gorgeous yard during the warmer months, with room to gather around a future firepit or bring your garden plans to life. When cooler weather arrives, settle in by the fireplace. Conveniently located near Norwalk's many amenities, this property offers both privacy and accessibility. Step inside, reimagine the possibilities, and begin your next chapter at 18 Chatham Drive. Subject to Probate Court Approval. See Agent Remarks.",
